meta {
  name: Create Regularization (future date - expect 400)
  type: http
  seq: 34
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/attendance/regularizations
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "work_date": "2099-01-01",
    "requested_status_name": "present",
    "reason": "Filed for a day that has not happened"
  }
}

docs {
  Negative case for the future-date rule.

  EXPECT 400: "A regularization cannot be filed for a future date."

  Unlike the backdate window this is NOT configurable — correcting a day that
  has not happened yet is meaningless, and it would resolve an approver chain as
  of a date no reporting line covers. Widening
  regularization_max_backdate_days to 365 does not make this request succeed.
}
